[Messages]
WelcomeLabel2=Install OpenCrate to control RGB lighting, fans and Windows power settings.%n%nAn open-source alternative to Armoury Crate.
SetupAppRunningError=OpenCrate is running.%n%nChoose Quit from its tray menu, then click OK. Closing its window only hides it to the tray.
UninstallAppRunningError=OpenCrate is running.%n%nChoose Quit from its tray menu before uninstalling so temporary fan settings can be restored. Then click OK.
